<section class="section" style="padding-top: 9rem;">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="badge badge-emerald"><i data-lucide="users"></i> Community Standards</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Community Guidelines</h1>
      <p>Building an encouraging, respectful, science-based fitness environment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card prose reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2>1. Respect Every Fitness Journey</h2>
      <p>Beyounge is home to users of all ages, body shapes, backgrounds, and experience levels. We maintain zero tolerance for body shaming, harassment, hate speech, or toxic elitism.</p>

      <h2>2. Authentic Workouts & Fair Play</h2>
      <p>Do not post false workout entries or exploit system bugs to manipulate monthly challenge leaderboards. Keep leaderboards inspiring and authentic.</p>

      <h2>3. Safety First</h2>
      <p>Do not encourage extreme, dangerous, or medically unverified starvation diets or unsafe lifting practices.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

